    "body": "Returned-test root cause found and repaired in source: the animal-diamond generator and verifier explicitly forced every nontransparent pixel white, so a contrasting outline was impossible. The regenerated 8x-supersampled icon now follows the vanilla pattern: white tintable center, opaque near-black rim, feathered alpha. Installed logs already prove blip creation, so this is an art repair. Remains actionable until the rebuilt inventory archive is installed and the rim is visible under red/blue/grey styles.",
